Task 3: Set keystore directory for Java versions less than 11
Description Task 3: Configure the java_keystore_dir fact to use the legacy keystore directory when running Java versions older than 11.

Task 4: Set keystore directory for Java versions 11 or newer
Description Task 4: Configure the java_keystore_dir fact to use the new keystore directory when running Java versions 11 or newer.

